source: forge/tests/surface.rs
expression: "forge(&[\"enroll\"], &[])"
---
exit: 2
--- stdout
--- stderr
Enroll a TPM2 or a security key to unlock the LUKS disk of this host

Usage: forge enroll <COMMAND>

Commands:
  tpm2   Enroll the TPM2 bound to Secure Boot, as the tpm2-enroll service does at boot
  fido2  Enroll a FIDO2 security key, the passphrase stays as a fallback
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
